silm:instances_papers_07_the_canonical_question_chapters_09_proof_units_sections_01_profile_functoriality_concrete_anchor_5#adoptionprofile_mittens silm:hasLongDescription "The AdoptionProfile_{Mittens} is AdoptionProfile_Mittens: Dr. Osei's signed adoption-profile cocone target receiving the same compatible legs as a competing apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Y', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
